<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Don't Buy the Liverwurst (Allan Sherman)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">parody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">McDonald's Is My Kind of Place</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1960s</span><span class="sg-chain-h">jingle to the tune</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">U.N. Me (Animaniacs)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">parody</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Book of Isaiah 2:4</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the refrain refers to its verse on learning war no more</span></li></ul></section>
